# Testimony Of Fate (Q219), last part: a level 38 Palus Knight at cond 16 holding the Palus charm and Thifiell's letter, and 9 of
# each skull, takes the letter to Arkenia; Bloody Pixy, once asked for a garnet, trades 10 of each skull for the red fairy dust; the Blight
# Treant, asked for a seed, trades it and a leaf the Black Willow Lurker drops for the sap; Arkenia turns the dust and the sap into her
# letter; then relog, and Thifiell gives the Mark of Fate (the character is a dark elf of the first class change) and, once the quest is
# over, says so. Every script roll is pinned to 1, so every drop lands.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
